[l_braz_por]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=Sabotar recursos
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=A resistência no território inimigo nos informou sobre os esforços inimigos para extrair recursos no estado. Um probleminha calculado evitaria isso.

[l_english]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=Sabotage Resources
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=§LResistance in enemy territory has informed us of enemy efforts to extract resources in the state. A well-placed wrench thrown into those plans would prevent that.§!

[l_french]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=Sabotage des ressources
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=§LLes résistants nous ont informés que l'ennemi extrait de nombreuses ressources dans cet État. Une simple clef à molette pourrait faire s'enrayer toute cette belle machine de guerre.§!

[l_german]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=Ressourcen sabotieren
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=Der örtliche Widerstand hat uns informiert, dass der Feind in dem Staat Ressourcen extrahieren möchte. Wir können das mit ein wenig Sabotage verhindern.

[l_japanese]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=資源への妨害工作
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=§L敵領地のレジスタンスは州における敵の資源採掘への注力を我々に知らせた。うまくやれば採掘プランを妨害できる。§!

[l_korean]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=자원 사보타주
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=§L적지의 저항 세력에 따르면, 적은 해당 주에서 자원 채굴을 시도하고 있습니다. 적절한 조치를 취한다면 이 계획을 좌절시킬 수 있을 것입니다.§!

[l_polish]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=Sabotaż surowców
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=Ruch oporu na terenie wroga poinformował nas, że wróg zamierza wydobywać surowce na terenie tego kraju. Warto pokrzyżować te plany.

[l_russian]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=Подорвать добычу ресурсов
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=§LСопротивление на территории противника сообщило нам о намерениях врагов добывать там ресурсы. Если помешать планам противника, ресурсы не попадут к нему в руки.§!

[l_simp_chinese]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=破坏资源
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=§L敌占区的抵抗运动使我们了解到敌马企图开采该地区的资源。如果对这些计划进行适当的调整，就可以避免发生这种情况。§!

[l_spanish]
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources=Sabotear recursos
operation_targeted_sabotage_resources_desc=La resistencia en territorio enemigo nos ha informado de los esfuerzos del enemigo para extraer recursos en el Estado. Hay que ponerles trabas para impedirlo.
